  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: 'Where have you been? I was about to close the stall and go home!

'
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "The road is bumpy, Lan! I\u2019m trying to keep your stuff from falling
      apart."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: You young people are so fragile. A few bumps and you act like the world
      is ending! Tuan Anh says real riders don't feel the road.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Tuan Anh doesn't carry fifty pounds of supplies on his back.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: 'Fair enough. Stop whining and get moving. Ok, so I will just give you
      the parcel, deliver it safe and sound for me, take care!

'
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
